{'symbol': 'MMM', 'date': '2022-04-15 10:15:00', 'title': '3M AND THE NATIONAL COALITION OF CERTIFICATION CENTERS AWARD NATIONAL SCHOLARSHIPS', 'text': "ST. PAUL, MINN. , APRIL 15, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- 3M'S SAFETY AND INDUSTRIAL BUSINESS GROUP AND THE NATIONAL COALITION OF CERTIFICATION CENTERS (NC3) HAVE ANNOUNCED THE WINNERS FOR THE SKILLED TRADES - 3M TRANSFORMATIONAL SCHOLARSHIP FOR STUDENTS WITH A FOCUS IN SKILLED TRADES."}